📚 Student Management System – API Endpoints (Industry Ready)

Base URL

/api/v1

🔐 1. Auth / User APIs

Purpose: Login, role-based access

Method	Endpoint	                Description
POST	/auth/login	            Login user          done
POST    /auth/refresh           Refresh access token    done
GET	    /auth/me	            Get logged-in user profile      done
POST	/auth/logout	        Logout                  done
PATCH	/auth/change-password	Change password         done


🏢 2. Department APIs
Method	    Endpoint	                Description
POST	/departments	        Create department       done
GET	    /departments	        Get all departments     done
GET	    /departments/:id	    Get department by ID    done
PATCH	/departments/:id	    Update department       done
DELETE	/departments/:id	    Delete department       done
PATCH	/departments/:id/hod	Assign Head of Department   done


🎓 3. Student APIs
Method	        Endpoint	            Description
POST	        /students	            Create student      done
GET	            /students	            Get all students (filter by status, department)     done
GET	            /students/:id	        Get student details     done
PATCH	        /students/:id	        Update student          done
DELETE	        /students/:id	        Soft delete / suspend student       done
PATCH	        /students/:id/status	Change status (active, graduated, suspended)    done
GET	            /students/:id/courses	Student enrolled courses        done
GET	            /students/:id/payments	Student payment history         done
GET	            /students/:id/attendance	Student attendance          done


👨‍🏫 4. Instructor APIs
Method	        Endpoint	            Description
POST	       /instructors	            Create instructor       done
GET	           /instructors	            Get all instructors     done
GET	           /instructors/:id	        Get instructor          done
PATCH	       /instructors/:id	        Update instructor       done
PATCH          /instructors/:id/status  Activate / Deactivate   
DELETE	       /instructors/:id	        Remove instructor
GET	           /instructors/:id/courses	Courses taught


